 ## T21 compiled-journey fixture: Lobby is the entry app and carries NO
 ## crud/scenario items on purpose (see below); Store carries the Gadget
 ## crud the journey exercises. Multi-app sources are ordinary CanLang
 ## (TeamTasks.can itself has three apps).
