 ## WHY TWO APPS (L1 defect, T21 finding 2026-10-06): entry-module crud
 ## currently emits unimportable JS — `export const create=` collides
 ## with the `import { create }` stdlib binding, and `export const
 ## delete=` is a reserved-word SyntaxError (`emit_identity_consts` in
 ## compiler/src/codegen/js.rs reserves neither import names nor
 ## reserved words). Non-entry crud emits prefixed idents
 ## (`Store_create`, …) which load fine — hence this shape. Single-app
 ## crud re-emits the defect; the L1 fix slice owns the regression test.
